<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $54 (FIM 249.20).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $54 (FIM 249.20).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR fell $1 to end at $54 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 249.20 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Monday, Nokia A closed up 0.50 markka at 254.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $0-1/8 at $34-1/8 on Wall Street on Monday. The price equals about 78.70 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet rose 1.40 markka to close at 79.00 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed down $0-1/4 at $19 in New York on Monday. The price corresponds to about 87.70 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 1.00 higher at 90.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
